---
<div class="my-8 flex flex-col items-center">
  <div class="relative w-full border-l-[3px] border-[#C7A340] bg-zinc-50 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm dark:bg-zinc-900/40 dark:border-[#C7A340]/80">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-[#C7A340] dark:text-[#E5C158] uppercase">
        Offerings:
      </span>
      <!-- "V" Logo Placeholder -->
      <span class="text-[#C7A340] opacity-80 dark:opacity-60">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 19L5 5H8.5L12 14.5L15.5 5H19L12 19Z"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Item 1 -->
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-2">
        1. Consultation Call
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Are you dealing with a bottleneck in your data pipeline, AI architecture, or quant infrastructure? Book a focused 60-minute technical tear-down with me to unblock your team.
      </p>
      <a href="/book-a-call" class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#C7A340] dark:text-[#E5C158] hover:underline">
        Book a 1-on-1 Session &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Divider -->
    <hr class="border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 my-6" />

    <!-- Item 2 -->
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-2">
        2. Custom Algorithmic Trading Setups
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Want to automate your alpha? I partner with a select few funds and trading desks to build proprietary algorithmic trading setups, low-latency execution bots, and tick-level backtesting frameworks from scratch.
      </p>
      <a href="/services/quant-trading" class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#C7A340] dark:text-[#E5C158] hover:underline">
        Explore Quant & Algo Trading Services &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Button below -->
  <div class="mt-8">
    <a href="/markets" class="inline-block bg-zinc-950 text-white dark:bg-zinc-100 dark:text-zinc-950 px-8 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-zinc-800 dark:hover:bg-zinc-300 transition-colors">
      View All Research &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
